  "prefLabel": "Rko 203.03 Effect of Filing",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Rko 203.03 Effect of Filing. Pursuant to RSA 91-A:7, II, a person’s decision to file a complaint with the ombudsman forecloses the ability to petition the superior court until the ombudsman issues a final ruling or the deadline for such ruling has passed.\n\nSource. #13921, eff 5-20-24",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/rko100-200.html"
